Adds sections covering the fast-rpc work that landed since the last README
refresh: bulk BlockHashInRange path in get_hashes (enables 16-parallel
fast_refresh from the wallet), empty-block_ids fix in get_blocks (needed for
speculative prefetch), LMDB max_readers 126 → 512 (prevents ReadersFull panic
under parallel-client load), and the X-Perf-Req-Id / PERF RPC logging used
for cross-machine sync diagnostics. Adds Ledger-restore benchmark table
(16 min → 3–4 min with tex8com/monero-gui fast-crypto) and notes the
remaining HTTP/1.1 per-connection-variance ceiling.
